<title>INDIA: ConAgra buying into India ITC Agro - paper.</title>
<headline>ConAgra buying into India ITC Agro - paper.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. food giant ConAgra Inc will acquire 51.29 percent of ITC Agro-Tech Ltd, the Business Standard newspaper said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;ConAgra will pick up a 51.29 percent holding in ITC Agro-Tech against its earlier plan of acquiring a 34 percent stake,&quot; the newspaper reported.</p>
<p>It said Indian tobacco major ITC Ltd's stake in ITC Agro-Tech will drop to 19.69 percent from 41 percent after ConAgra's acquisition.</p>
<p>The company will seek shareholder approval for the move at its annual general meeting on August 8 at Hyderabad, it said.</p>
<p>ITC Agro-Tech officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
